D('P0137','O2 sensor circuit low voltage (Bank 1 sensor 2)',SYS.emis,1,'The downstream O2 sensor stays at low voltage.',['Exhaust leak near the sensor','Faulty sensor','Short to ground'],['Check for exhaust leaks','Replace the sensor']);
