D('P0141','O2 sensor heater circuit (Bank 1 sensor 2)',SYS.emis,1,'The downstream O2 sensor heater has failed.',['Burnt-out heater','Blown fuse','Damaged wiring'],['Check fuse','Measure heater resistance','Replace the sensor']);
D('P0151','O2 sensor circuit low voltage (Bank 2 sensor 1)',SYS.emis,2,'The Bank 2 upstream O2 sensor reads lean constantly.',['Faulty sensor','Exhaust leak','Real lean condition on Bank 2'],['Check exhaust leaks and fuel trims','Replace the sensor']);
