D('P0325','Knock sensor 1 circuit (Bank 1)',SYS.ign,1,'The knock sensor signal is out of range. The computer will retard timing for safety, reducing power and economy.',['Faulty knock sensor','Damaged wiring (often under the intake manifold)','Loose sensor (wrong torque)'],['Inspect wiring and connector','Check sensor mounting torque','Replace the sensor']);
